"Le jeton de licence est invalide. Veuillez le télécharger à nouveau depuis "
"votre compte agentic-plugin.com."

#: admin/agents.php:339
msgid "Your agent license has expired. Please renew at agentic-plugin.com."
msgstr ""
"Votre licence d’agent a expiré. Veuillez la renouveler sur agentic-"
"plugin.com."

#: admin/agents.php:340
msgid ""
"This license has already been activated on a different domain. Use your "
